doc:Factsarticle1_6 schema:abstract "Digital twins enable real-time monitoring, diagnostics, and predictive maintenance. The paper proposes a model-based, control-driven approach to multi-component degradation detection and benchmarks PI, LQR, MPC, and a hybrid model in a hydraulic system testbed." .
